* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf

# Source models (roadmap P-5). External GLB/FBX actors and their sidecar
# buffers/textures under apps/hmh-reboot/assets/source/models/ travel through
# Git LFS. These lines come after the generic binary macros above on purpose:
# gitattributes resolves later matching lines last, and `-text` keeps Git from
# ever autodetecting a GLB as text. Per-file cap 40 MB, PNG textures <= 2048 px
# per edge, verified by `npm run assets:hmh:models:lfs-check`.
apps/hmh-reboot/assets/source/models/**/*.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
apps/hmh-reboot/assets/source/models/**/*.fbx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
apps/hmh-reboot/assets/source/models/**/*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
apps/hmh-reboot/assets/source/models/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
apps/hmh-reboot/assets/source/models/**/*.jpg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
apps/hmh-reboot/assets/source/models/**/*.jpeg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Owner-supplied design references, source-only; never copied to the portal.
apps/hmh-reboot/assets/source/reference/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
